{
  "project_name": "SkylineGlider",
  "company_name": "MyCompany",
  "description": "A relaxing glider game. The player soars between floating islands in an endless blue sky, riding thermals and collecting ring gates. There is no combat and no landing objective — the ceiling of the flyable airspace is 900m and the islands drift beneath it. Cloud banks and airship wrecks make up the traffic the player weaves through.",
